   $E=-\eta_{\rm rec}/\kappa_{\rm rec}$. It is retained exactly when
   $Q_{\rm rec}(E)=0$ and all of (57.2) hold.
2. If $\kappa_{\rm rec}=0$ and $\eta_{\rm rec}\ne0$, there are no
   candidates and hence no worlds of this width in (54.1).
